35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, February was almost thirty thousand yen! And people were late paying because the numbers kept changing. That feels really stressful.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The variance is extreme. February’s cost is triple August’s. This confirms the current flat split is fundamentally broken.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,Forty minutes of logging and hand-splitting? That’s way too long! I can’t give up my evenings just to do math.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the variance is obvious. But sub-meters cost thirty-four thousand yen per room. That’s a massive upfront cost for a problem we can solve with basic math.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the cooler notice shows people avoiding shared costs to dodge conflict. That silence is exactly what I’m worried about.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that silence is scary! I don’t want us to avoid talking about money. Let’s make sure the new plan is clear so nobody feels awkward.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, thirty-four thousand yen per room is a significant barrier. I need to know if that cost is justified by the data before we commit.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, forty minutes is still too much! I want a system that takes five minutes, not an hour.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, five minutes is a fantasy. The data shows a four-to-one usage gap. We need a method that reflects that reality, not just your convenience.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, the winter habits show that fixed costs remove the anxiety of calculating every switch. We need that same peace of mind here.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I totally agree! I sat in a coat last winter just to save money. I want a system where we don’t have to think about every switch.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, fixed costs hide the variance I just documented. I need to see the sunlight and heating data to justify any such structure.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, I get it, but I can’t do forty minutes of math! I need a plan that’s quick and easy for everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, sunlight is irrelevant to the heater. The data proves the gap. We need a split that reflects actual consumption, not just comfort.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, I understand the need for data. But if the system causes us to avoid each other, the math is useless. We need a balance.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I’m done looking into things. I just want us to feel safe and warm here, not stressed by bills. Let’s find a kind solution!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will not commit to a structure until I understand the seasonal variance. The data shows the current method is unsustainable.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I’m done! I need a system that takes five minutes, not an hour. Let’s find a quick, easy way to split the bills!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The data is clear. Four-to-one usage gap. Sub-meters are overkill. We need a simple, consumption-based split. I’m ready to vote.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I’m ready. We need a method that respects the data but protects our relationships from the stress of constant calculation.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
